title: "Argentina Travel Archive and Project 23"
abstract: >-
  This dataset contains a structured archive of Argentina-focused travel, media reference,
  article, video transcript, and photography metadata records from the Samuel & Audrey
  Media Network. It includes 10,142 records connected to Project 23, a long-term effort
  to document Argentina's 23 provinces through travel guides, videos, photography,
  regional logistics, cultural coverage, and public source records.
